Cell["\<\
Unfortunately, to be sure that no more elements can be generated we have to \
take large \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]StartingElement\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
list, in ideal case equal to the number of commuting list of  blade which \
squares to 1.\
\>", "Text",
